    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you tired of the daily hunting and gathering work? Why not head to the endless wilderness and embark on an exciting treasure hunt journey. You will lead a group of primitive people to explore unknown wilderness, tackle various survival challenges, and find a unique treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Allocate your resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each tribe member can provide different resources and can be dispatched to work for the tribe on hunting days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Solve survival problems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encountering various unexpected events every day in the wilderness, using props to solve problems and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Searching for mysterious treasures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate destination of adventure is undoubtedly a unique treasure. Can your tribe find the whereabouts of the treasure from the complex daily events?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wildfire is a strategy and resource management game where you need to make choices based on events, whether to use props to solve today's problems or leave resources for tomorrow's unknown challenges, and ultimately find the treasure in the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is my first independently developed game, and there are many obvious problems, but at least finished. Feel free to contact me with email if you have any intention for cooperation.\u00a0</p>",
